  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assam Climate Resilient Value Chain and Enterprise Promotion Project  (ACE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to contribute to the sustained prosperity of rural households.  The project objective is to enhance rural prosperity through sustained income growth by strengthening community and public institutions, improving production, productivity, value addition and marketing in key value chains through climate-resilient practices, and promoting micro enterprises for small and medium farmers and livelihood diversification for land poor.</narrative>
  </description>
